								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=3.msg3#msg3">Why'd I do this?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> April 03, 2003, 02:39:15 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I hate popup adds mainly.<br /><br />That and so many other servers have a nice community message board. I hated that Rodcet doesn't seem to anymore. At least since the EZboards thing and that boards relative ghost town status.<br /><br />So here it is, use it if you want. If you don't, I'll just make a big pron site out of it.... hmmm, maybe I shoulda done that first.
